<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#101828">
<title>StudySprint — Exam Tracker</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#f5f7fb;--panel:#fff;--ink:#172033;--muted:#687386;--line:#e5e9f1;--nav:#111a2e;--blue:#4169e1;--blue-soft:#edf2ff;--green:#16835d;--green-soft:#e6f7ef;--orange:#bd6b13;--orange-soft:#fff2df;--red:#c33e52;--shadow:0 10px 35px rgba(21,34,61,.06);--radius:18px}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.5 Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif}button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer}.app{display:grid;grid-template-columns:250px minmax(0,1fr);min-height:100vh}.sidebar{background:var(--nav);color:#eef2ff;padding:26px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:0 10px}.logo{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8ca6ff,#536de8);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900;color:white;font-size:20px}.brand strong{font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.5px}.brand small{display:block;color:#aab5cb;font-size:12px}.nav-label{color:#7f8da8;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.4px;font-weight:800;padding:0 12px;margin-bottom:7px}.navbtn{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-align:left;border:0;background:transparent;color:#b9c4d9;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;margin:2px 0}.navbtn .ico{width:22px;text-align:center;font-size:17px}.navbtn.active,.navbtn:hover{background:#25314b;color:white}.sidebar-foot{margin-top:auto;border:1px solid #34415c;border-radius:14px;padding:14px;color:#b8c3d7;font-size:12px}.sidebar-foot strong{color:white;display:block;margin-bottom:4px}.main{min-width:0}.topbar{height:78px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.86);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 34px;gap:15px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;backdrop-filter:blur(14px)}.crumb{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.topbar h1{font-size:18px;margin:2px 0 0;letter-spacing:-.4px}.top-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}.content{padding:30px 34px 50px;max-width:1500px;margin:auto}.welcome{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:20px;margin-bottom:24px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase}.welcome h2{font-size:29px;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:5px 0}.welcome p{color:var(--muted);margin:0}.date-chip{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap}.grid{display:grid;gap:16px}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));margin-bottom:18px}.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);min-width:0}.stat-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.stat-icon{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:11px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--blue-soft);font-size:18px}.stat-value{font-size:30px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:12px 0 3px}.stat-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.dashboard-grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.2fr) minmax(300px,.8fr)}.section-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:15px}.section-title h3{font-size:16px;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.3px}.section-title p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:3px 0 0}.btn{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 13px;background:white;color:var(--ink);font-weight:650;font-size:13px}.btn:hover{border-color:#b5c4e7;background:#f9faff}.btn.primary{background:var(--blue);color:white;border-color:var(--blue)}.btn.dark{background:var(--nav);color:white;border-color:var(--nav)}.btn.danger{color:var(--red)}.btn.small{padding:6px 9px;font-size:12px}.progress-row{margin:17px 0}.progress-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px}.progress-top span:last-child{color:var(--muted)}.track{height:9px;background:#edf0f6;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden}.fill{height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:var(--blue);transition:width .2s}.fill.green{background:#21a675}.fill.orange{background:#e5a23a}.legend{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:14px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:6px}.empty{padding:26px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);background:#fafbfe;border:1px dashed #d8dfeb;border-radius:14px}.empty strong{display:block;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:5px}.platforms{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.platform{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px}.platform .name{font-weight:750}.platform .num{font-size:25px;font-weight:800;margin:8px 0 1px}.platform small{color:var(--muted)}.tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:99px;font-size:11px;font-weight:750;background:#eef1f7;color:#526078}.tag.blue{background:var(--blue-soft);color:#3456c5}.tag.green{background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green)}.tag.orange{background:var(--orange-soft);color:var(--orange)}.page-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:15px;margin-bottom:20px}.page-head h2{font-size:27px;letter-spacing:-.8px;margin:4px 0}.page-head p{color:var(--muted);margin:0}.filters{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:15px}.field, .filters input,.filters select{border:1px solid #dce2ed;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 11px;background:white;color:var(--ink);min-width:0}.filters input{flex:1;min-width:180px}.table-wrap{overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:white}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:850px;font-size:13px}th{background:#f8f9fc;text-align:left;color:#657086;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;padding:13px 14px;white-space:nowrap}td{padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid #edf0f5;vertical-align:middle}tr:hover td{background:#fcfdff}td input[type=text],td input[type=number],td input[type=date],td select,td textarea{width:100%;min-width:100px;border:1px solid transparent;background:transparent;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;color:var(--ink)}td input:focus,td select:focus,td textarea:focus{outline:2px solid #cdd8ff;background:white}.check{width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:var(--blue)}.link{color:var(--blue);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}.link:hover{text-decoration:underline}.table-note{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;padding:12px 2px}.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.form-field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.form-field label{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700}.form-field input,.form-field select,.form-field textarea{width:100%;padding:11px 12px;border:1px solid #dce2ed;border-radius:10px;background:white;color:var(--ink)}.form-field.full{grid-column:1/-1}.form-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:16px}.hidden{display:none!important}.toast{position:fixed;bottom:20px;right:20px;background:#172033;color:white;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);z-index:20;opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px);transition:.2s;pointer-events:none}.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}.callout{border:1px solid #d8e3ff;background:#f2f6ff;border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;color:#41537e;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:16px}.callout strong{color:#203e95}.branch-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));margin-bottom:16px}.branch-card{padding:16px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:white}.branch-card .emoji{font-size:22px}.branch-card strong{display:block;margin:7px 0 2px}.branch-card small{color:var(--muted)}.mobile-menu{display:none}
@media(max-width:1100px){.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.branch-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.dashboard-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.form-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
@media(max-width:760px){#page-habits .grid[style*="grid-template-columns:repeat(2"]{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}.app{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sidebar{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:260px;z-index:15;box-shadow:20px 0 50px #0003}.sidebar.open{display:flex}.mobile-menu{display:inline-flex}.topbar{height:68px;padding:0 16px}.content{padding:22px 15px 40px}.welcome{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.welcome h2{font-size:25px}.date-chip{display:none}.stats{gap:10px}.card{padding:16px}.stat-value{font-size:25px}.page-head{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.branch-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.top-actions .desktop-only{display:none}.platforms{gap:8px}.platform{padding:12px}.platform .num{font-size:21px}}

/* Personal-life modules */
.module-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(280px,.72fr);gap:16px;margin-bottom:18px}
.form-card h3{margin:0 0 15px;font-size:16px}.records{display:grid;gap:10px}.record{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:15px;background:#fff}.record-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}.record h4{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px}.record p{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.record-meta{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.record-actions{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}.habit-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.habit-check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:11px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;font-size:13px}.habit-check input{accent-color:var(--green);width:17px;height:17px}.mood{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.mood label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;font-size:13px}.voice-panel{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eff3ff,#f8f5ff);border:1px solid #dfe5ff;border-radius:16px;padding:18px}.voice-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}.audio-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.audio-row audio{max-width:100%;height:34px}.privacy-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f9fc;border-radius:12px;margin-top:12px}.rec-indicator{color:var(--red);font-weight:800;display:none}.rec-indicator.on{display:inline}.habit-summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.habit-summary .mini{padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px}.habit-summary strong{font-size:22px;display:block}.habit-summary span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
@media(max-width:1100px){.module-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.habit-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.habit-summary{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
@media(max-width:600px){.habit-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.habit-summary{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}


/* Cloud status lives inside the top bar flow; never floats over action buttons. */
.cloud-status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;max-width:180px;min-width:96px;padding:6px 9px;border:1px solid #dce9df;border-radius:999px;background:#f0faf3;color:#16835d;font-size:12px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.25;white-space:normal;text-align:center;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
@media(max-width:760px){.cloud-status{max-width:120px;min-width:0;font-size:11px;padding:5px 7px}.top-actions{gap:6px}}
</style>
</head>
<body><div class="app">
<aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
  <div class="brand"><div class="logo">S</div><div><strong>StudySprint</strong><small>Exam prep workspace</small></div></div>
  <div><div class="nav-label">WORKSPACE</div>
    <button class="navbtn active" data-page="dashboard"><span class="ico">▦</span>Dashboard</button>
    <button class="navbtn" data-page="lectures"><span class="ico">▤</span>Priyanshu · Lectures</button>
    <button class="navbtn" data-page="mocks"><span class="ico">◷</span>Priyanshu · Mock tests</button>
    <button class="navbtn" data-page="sona"><span class="ico">◎</span>Sona · Geography</button>
    <button class="navbtn" data-page="calls"><span class="ico">☎</span>Call records</button>
    <button class="navbtn" data-page="meetups"><span class="ico">▣</span>Meetups & Google Meet</button>
    <button class="navbtn" data-page="diary"><span class="ico">✎</span>Diary & messages</button>
    <button class="navbtn" data-page="library"><span class="ico">📚</span>Library check-in/out</button>
    <button class="navbtn" data-page="manifestation"><span class="ico">✨</span>Daily manifestation</button>
    <button class="navbtn" data-page="voice"><span class="ico">♫</span>Daily voice notes</button>
    <button class="navbtn" data-page="habits"><span class="ico">☀</span>Daily wellness</button>
  </div>
  <div><div class="nav-label">DATA & SETTINGS</div>
    <button class="navbtn" id="exportBtn"><span class="ico">⇩</span>Export backup</button>
    <button class="navbtn" id="importBtn"><span class="ico">⇧</span>Import backup</button>
    <button class="navbtn" id="printBtn"><span class="ico">▧</span>Print / Save PDF</button>
    <input type="file" id="importFile" accept=".json,application/json" class="hidden">
  </div>
  <div class="sidebar-foot"><strong>Private by default</strong>Your entries stay in this browser. Export a backup before switching devices or clearing browser data.</div>
</aside>
<main class="main">
  <header class="topbar">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px"><button class="btn mobile-menu" id="menuBtn">☰</button><div><div class="crumb">Study workspace / <span id="crumb">Dashboard</span></div><h1 id="topTitle">Your preparation at a glance</h1></div></div>
    <div class="top-actions"><span id="cloudStatus" class="cloud-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Connecting cloud…</span><button class="btn desktop-only" id="topExport">Export backup</button><button class="btn primary" id="quickAdd">＋ Quick add</button></div>
  </header>
  <div class="content">
    <section id="page-dashboard">
      <div class="welcome"><div><div class="eyebrow">Your study command center</div><h2>Small steps. Strong results.</h2><p>Track lectures, revisions and mock-test performance in one visual workspace.</p></div><div class="date-chip" id="today"></div></div>
      <div class="grid stats">
        <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Lectures completed <span class="stat-icon">✓</span></div><div class="stat-value" id="statCompleted">0 <span style="font-size:15px;color:#8b95a7">/ 150</span></div><div class="stat-note" id="statCompletedNote">Across Reasoning, Maths & English</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Revision sessions <span class="stat-icon" style="background:var(--green-soft)">↻</span></div><div class="stat-value" id="statRevisions">0</div><div class="stat-note">Date entries recorded by Priyanshu</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Mock tests logged <span class="stat-icon" style="background:var(--orange-soft)">◷</span></div><div class="stat-value" id="statMocks">0</div><div class="stat-note">Testbook + Oliveboard</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Geography topics <span class="stat-icon" style="background:#f4eaff">◎</span></div><div class="stat-value" id="statTopics">0</div><div class="stat-note">Topics added to Sona's tracker</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card" id="rewardsCard" style="margin:0 0 18px">
        <div class="section-title"><div><h3>🏆 Separate reward scoreboards</h3><p>Healthy progress game: earn points, hit targets, and take breaks when needed.</p></div><span class="tag blue">Rewards</span></div>
        <div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px" id="rewardPeople">
          <div class="branch-card">
            <div style="font-size:18px">🌷 <strong>Sona</strong></div>
            <div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
              <div><small>Today</small><strong id="sonaPointsDaily">0 pts</strong></div>
              <div><small>This week</small><strong id="sonaPointsWeekly">0 pts</strong><small id="sonaWeeklyTargetLabel">Target: 250 pts</small></div>
              <div><small>This month</small><strong id="sonaPointsMonthly">0 pts</strong><small id="sonaMonthlyTargetLabel">Target: 1000 pts</small></div>
              <div><small>Lifetime</small><strong id="sonaPointsTotal">0 pts</strong></div>
              <div><small>Daily average</small><strong id="sonaPointsAverage">0 pts</strong></div>
            </div>
            <div class="track" style="margin-top:12px"><div class="fill green" id="sonaDailyTargetBar" style="width:0%"></div></div>
            <small id="sonaTargetLabel">Daily target: 40 pts</small>
          </div>
          <div class="branch-card">
            <div style="font-size:18px">⚡ <strong>Priyanshu</strong></div>
            <div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
              <div><small>Today</small><strong id="priyanshuPointsDaily">0 pts</strong></div>
              <div><small>This week</small><strong id="priyanshuPointsWeekly">0 pts</strong><small id="priyanshuWeeklyTargetLabel">Target: 250 pts</small></div>
              <div><small>This month</small><strong id="priyanshuPointsMonthly">0 pts</strong><small id="priyanshuMonthlyTargetLabel">Target: 1000 pts</small></div>
              <div><small>Lifetime</small><strong id="priyanshuPointsTotal">0 pts</strong></div>
              <div><small>Daily average</small><strong id="priyanshuPointsAverage">0 pts</strong></div>
            </div>
            <div class="track" style="margin-top:12px"><div class="fill" id="priyanshuDailyTargetBar" style="width:0%"></div></div>
            <small id="priyanshuTargetLabel">Daily target: 40 pts</small>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-title" style="margin-top:16px"><div><h3>Recent rewards</h3><p>Who earned what, and when</p></div></div>
        <div id="rewardHistory" class="records"></div>
        <div class="privacy-note"><strong>Study-first points:</strong> lecture +10; revision +5; mock test +20; Geography topic +10; library check-in +5 and check-out +10; each checked wellness habit +2; completed manifestation activity +5. Photos, voice notes, calls, messages and meetups earn no points. Old study/library/wellness records are backfilled once; records without dates count toward lifetime totals only.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid dashboard-grid">
        <div class="card"><div class="section-title"><div><h3>Lecture completion</h3><p>Progress by bank-exam subject</p></div><button class="btn small" data-go="lectures">Open tracker ↗</button></div><div id="subjectProgress"></div><div class="legend"><span><i class="dot" style="background:var(--blue)"></i>Completed</span><span><i class="dot" style="background:#edf0f6"></i>Remaining</span></div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="section-title"><div><h3>Mock platform comparison</h3><p>Average score percentage</p></div><button class="btn small" data-go="mocks">View tests ↗</button></div><div class="platforms" id="platformStats"></div><div class="callout" style="margin:14px 0 0">Compare <strong>score percentage</strong> rather than raw marks when test maximums differ.</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="section-title"><div><h3>Latest activity</h3><p>Recently recorded study items</p></div></div><div id="activity"></div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="section-title"><div><h3>📚 Library attendance today</h3><p>Separate daily check-in and check-out for both</p></div><button class="btn small" data-go="library">Open attendance ↗</button></div><div id="dashboardLibraryAttendance"></div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="section-title"><div><h3>☀ Daily wellness today</h3><p>Separate habit logs for Sona and Priyanshu</p></div><button class="btn small" data-go="habits">Open wellness ↗</button></div><div id="dashboardWellness"></div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="section-title"><div><h3>Sona's Geography branches</h3><p>Topics and revision status</p></div><button class="btn small" data-go="sona">Open Geography ↗</button></div><div id="branchProgress"></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="page-lectures" class="hidden">
      <div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Priyanshu · Bank exam preparation</div><h2>Lecture tracker</h2><p>150 planned lecture slots across Reasoning, Maths and English.</p></div><button class="btn primary" id="addLecture">＋ Add topic</button></div>
      <div class="callout"><strong>How to use:</strong> Tick completion when you finish the first study session. Add real dates for each revision. Paste a permanent Google Drive PDF link. After saving, wait for the cloud status to say “Cloud synced”. Set Drive sharing to anyone with the link if you want the other device to open it.</div>
      <div class="filters"><input id="lectureSearch" placeholder="Search topic or lecture number…"><select id="subjectFilter"><option value="">All subjects</option><option>Reasoning</option><option>Maths</option><option>English</option></select><select id="completionFilter"><option value="">All completion states</option><option value="done">Completed</option><option value="todo">Not completed</option></select><select id="revisionFilter"><option value="">All revision states</option><option value="revised">Revised at least once</option><option value="pending">No revisions yet</option></select></div>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Subject</th><th>#</th><th>Topic</th><th>PDF notes</th><th>Done</th><th>Revision 1</th><th>Revision 2</th><th>Revision 3</th><th>Revisions</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="lectureRows"></tbody></table></div><div class="table-note"><span id="lectureCount">150 lecture slots</span><span>Changes save automatically in this browser.</span></div>
    </section>

    <section id="page-mocks" class="hidden">
      <div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Priyanshu · Performance</div><h2>Mock test tracker</h2><p>Log test scores, percentile and weak areas to plan your next revision.</p></div><button class="btn primary" id="addMock">＋ Add mock test</button></div>
      <div class="grid stats" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))">
        <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Tests logged</div><div class="stat-value" id="mockTotal">0</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Average score %</div><div class="stat-value" id="mockAverage">—</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Best score %</div><div class="stat-value" id="mockBest">—</div></div>
